Z||000004||fiero56||01-13-2001||07:29 PM||||I would assume it's the 4.10 gearing, since it is spinning so fast. I don't have that tranny, so somone with the 4.10FD would have to tell, but it sounds right to me. I'be heard that it's around 3,000 at 60mph with that one.<BR>I guess it's not an official term, but I use it. SE, Econo Coupe, Indy, Sport Coupe.<P>About the wiring, I haven't done it, but I would assume its from the switch on up, but don't take this as truth, its a guess. I'm sure mrfiero or others will post an answer in the thread about the wiring.<P>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 01-13-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by fiero56 (edited 01-13-2001).]||||reg||1
